   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Nightmare Kitchen. A\nmiracle ingredient turned\nthe Tater Hills Mall food\ninto mutants, and you're\non today's menu.",
   "start": 9.905,
   "duration": 6.863,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Go in alone, or bring up\nto three friends in co-op.",
   "start": 17.018,
   "duration": 3.128,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Every run through the\ndungeons is laid out\ndifferently, themed on\nAmerican, Mexican, Asian,\ndessert and health food.",
